From 0a3cf5f5ab7e77080eb9491cb6bffd5ba642cb68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:57:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(devices): add bounded supervisor-owned TCP backend

Provide explicit numeric endpoints, fixed connection slots and cumulative
transfer budgets with a nonblocking Linux TCP adapter. Expose endpoint
metadata, readiness, socket error and half-close through the owner and close
handles on final close, revocation or drop. Exercise local peers on Linux CI
without changing guest networking policy.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
